OL,3,GNEWSARunner aged 90 sets world best
OL,4,Atime for 10k in age group
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 90-year-old runner from North
OL,7,FLanarkshire is believed to have set a
OL,8,Fworld best time for a 10k race in his
OL,9,Fage group.
OL,11,FIan Winship completed the Cumbernauld
OL,12,F10k run on 13 September in one hour,
OL,13,Ffour minutes and 37 seconds.
OL,15,FWinship, a former paratrooper, said he
OL,16,F"stood greetin'" when he found out his
OL,17,Ftime at the end of the race.
OL,19,FHe said: "It's just unbelievable.
OL,20,FCumbernauld might be famous now because
OL,21,Fof me."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
